---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Inicio | Código Ágil - Software & Ciberseguridad">
	<div class="bg-[#FFFFFF] rounded-2xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center border border-[#D8DEE6]">
		<div class="p-10 md:p-16 md:w-1/2 reveal">
			<span class="text-[#69BC83] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block">Bienvenidos</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#687284] mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
				Convertimos tus ideas en <br/> <span class="text-[#69BC83]">código seguro y escalable.</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-[#687284] mb-8 leading-relaxed">
				Desarrollamos arquitecturas escalables y blindamos tu infraestructura digital. Transformamos tus desafíos complejos en sistemas seguros y eficientes.
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row space-y-4 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-4">
				<a href="/servicios" class="bg-[#69BC83] text-[#FFFFFF] text-center px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-[#56A772] transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
					Explorar Servicios
				</a>
				<a href="/contacto" class="bg-[#E8F8EE] text-[#69BC83] text-center px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-[#AEE8C0] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
					Auditoría Gratuita
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="md:w-1/2 bg-[#000000] w-full min-h-[400px] p-8 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#69BC83] via-[#000000] to-[#000000]"></div>
			<div class="relative z-10 text-left w-full max-w-sm bg-[#1A1D24] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#2D333B] shadow-2xl transition-transform hover:scale-105 duration-500">
				<div class="flex space-x-2 mb-4">
					<div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#FF5F56]"></div>
					<div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD2E]"></div>
					<div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#27C93F]"></div>
				</div>
				<pre class="text-[#69BC83] font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed">
> Iniciando escaneo de red...
> Vulnerabilidades detectadas: 0
> Encriptación AES-256: Activa
> Despliegue de software: Exitoso
> Sistema protegido y operando.
<span class="animate-pulse text-[#FFFFFF]">_</span>
				</pre>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>